	(text "SPI Write: data should be inverted first\nSDO=0, B4 is input, B4 pull up, TG_PGD=1.\nSDO=1, B4 is output, A4 pull down, TG_PGD=0.\nSPI_XFER(~data);\n\nSPI Read: SDO is always low\ndata=SPI_XFER(0x00);"
